@host = http://localhost:5233

### Health: database reachable and migrations applied
GET {{host}}/health

### Statuses translated by query parameter
GET {{host}}/api/statuses/Campaign?lang=ar

### Statuses translated by Accept-Language header
GET {{host}}/api/statuses/ContentItem
Accept-Language: ar-PS,ar;q=0.9,en;q=0.8

### Unknown status category -> 404 ProblemDetails
GET {{host}}/api/statuses/Unknown

### All platforms
GET {{host}}/api/platforms?lang=en

### One platform
GET {{host}}/api/platforms/instagram?lang=ar

### Unknown platform -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/platforms/myspace

### Detect platform from a pasted URL (tracking parameters removed)
GET {{host}}/api/platforms/detect?url=https://www.instagram.com/rival_cafe/?igshid=abc

### Invalid URL -> 400
GET {{host}}/api/platforms/detect?url=not a url

### Missing url -> 400 validation
GET {{host}}/api/platforms/detect
